   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Julia is in middle school and wonders why her physical education class is segregated by sex this year, unlike in elementary school. She also wonders why her female classmates giggle at her when she sometimes spends time talking to and playing with boys in her class at recess. Which concept best explains such segregation?",
